{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/hk/reviews/id1740406329?l=en"}, "name":{"label":"Sohal1234"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2026-04-01T02:35:43-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"1"}, "im:version":{"label":"3.68.5"}, "id":{"label":"13909994374"}, "title":{"label":"Account wouldn’t open after 20+ tries"}, "content":{"label":"I tried to open a hsbc teens account 20+ times, it wouldn’t work. I kept getting “your request can’t be handled at this moment” right after I took my verification picture. I changed my background, used a different device, tried wearing the same clothes as in the id picture, still wouldn’t work. I called the hotline, I messaged them on WhatsApp, I used in app chat. They all said the same thing “change your background lighting and try again” i asked them multiple times if i can get an human officer to review my id card picture and verify it. They said that can’t be done. I am so frustrated at this point.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/hk/review?id=1164066737&l=en&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
